# CBA - Compare Accumulators (opcode 0x11)

---
name: compares equal sets nothing
memory: 11
setup: a=10 b=01
expect: a=10 b=01 N=0 Z=0 C=0
cycles: 1

---
name: sets zero when equal
memory: 11
setup: a=10 b=10
expect: a=10 b=10 Z=1
cycles: 1

---
name: sets negative and carry when A less than B
memory: 11
setup: a=10 b=20
expect: a=10 b=20 N=1 C=1
cycles: 1
